# reprepro options, copied to <repo>/conf/options on the gh-pages branch.
#
# The repository root on gh-pages is the reprepro basedir, so dists/ and pool/
# end up where APT expects them:
#   https://<owner>.github.io/<repo>/dists/<suite>/InRelease
#   https://<owner>.github.io/<repo>/pool/main/...
#
# `conf/` and `db/` are therefore also published. They contain no secrets:
# the signing key lives only in the CI GNUPGHOME.
#
# The base directory itself is set with `reprepro -b <repo>`; output files are
# written relative to the basedir (the repository root), so no outdir override is
# needed. An explicit `outdir .` would be resolved against the process working
# directory instead, which is wrong in CI.
